  "description": "Includes all functionality to work with common files including BMP, ICO, CUR, CLP, PNG, GIF, TIFF and JFIF file formats. Includes Core ImageGear API, Display API, File format manager, general metadata API, Metadata dictionary API for the file common formats, CCITT, Deflate, LZW and JPEG compressions. Also provides support for simplified EXIF, IPTC and XMP Metadata API.",
